# NVIDIA-repo packages of both bases: Nsight Systems for CUDA 13.0 (Nsight Compute comes with
# the devel base). cuda-nsight-systems-13-0 only depends on the release that carries the tool,
# which apt would otherwise take at whatever version the live repository has, so both are
# pinned. Pinned into apt-nvidia.txt by
#   hls images lock-apt nvidia apt-nvidia
cuda-nsight-systems-13-0
nsight-systems-2025.3.2
